{"words": [{"text": "فَلَمَّآ", "translation": "But when"}, {"text": "ءَاتَىٰهُمَا", "translation": "He gives them"}, {"text": "صَـٰلِحًۭا", "translation": "a good, (child)"}, {"text": "جَعَلَا", "translation": "they make"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "for Him"}, {"text": "شُرَكَآءَ", "translation": "partners"}, {"text": "فِيمَآ", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "ءَاتَىٰهُمَا ۚ", "translation": "He has given them"}, {"text": "فَتَعَـٰلَى", "translation": "But exalted"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(is) Allah"}, {"text": "عَمَّا", "translation": "above what"}, {"text": "يُشْرِكُونَ", "translation": "they associate (with Him)"}], "sahih": "But when He gives them a good [child], they1 ascribe partners to Him concerning that which He has given them. Exalted is Allāh above what they associate with Him."}